      "writtenOn": "2020-07-09T23:44:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note: This logic should be in the DPM. The way things currently work, I think you can guarantee that once we start Enter USB, we won\u0027t make it back to DPM code until Enter USB has either succeeded or failed. For active-cable support, you might need to add an accessor to this file to check whether Enter USB is still in progress.",
