      "side": 1,
      "message": "pd_is_usb4_mode_capable - This function is defined in the new file that won\u0027t even compile if CONFIG_USB_PD_USB4 is not defined. So, In theory (I have not attempted it) this code will give compilation error if CONFIG_USB_PD_USB4 is not defined. I am guessing there are platforms which do not support USB4.",
